    {
      "subId": "7403304",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the trapped person",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740330401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740330401": {
            "id": "740330401",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Mitul, are you alright? I hope you weren't trapped for too long.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330402"
            ]
          },
          "740330402": {
            "id": "740330402",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "My savior! You're finally here!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330403"
            ]
          },
          "740330403": {
            "id": "740330403",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "Where's Koblenz? He's not with you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330404"
            ]
          },
          "740330404": {
            "id": "740330404",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "He told me about trapping you here and asked for my help, but he left because a guard interrupted us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330405"
            ]
          },
          "740330405": {
            "id": "740330405",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "I knew he wasn't reliable! He probably ran away because he felt guilty.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330406"
            ]
          },
          "740330406": {
            "id": "740330406",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "I mean, how do you make money in business if you don't take risks?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330407"
            ]
          },
          "740330407": {
            "id": "740330407",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "He was clumsy, and too cautious, to boot... I mean, Pure Water is one thing, but even Fonta is available nowadays.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330408"
            ]
          },
          "740330408": {
            "id": "740330408",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "If Fonta is here, how are we supposed to survive?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330409"
            ]
          },
          "740330409": {
            "id": "740330409",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330410"
            ]
          },
          "740330410": {
            "id": "740330410",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "What, you like Fonta too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330412",
              "740330414"
            ]
          },
          "740330412": {
            "id": "740330412",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "I do! I have to admit, it's a formidable rival...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330415"
            ]
          },
          "740330415": {
            "id": "740330415",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "Anyway, I have to settle this with Koblenz. By the way, has he paid you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330416"
            ]
          },
          "740330416": {
            "id": "740330416",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Nope.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330417"
            ]
          },
          "740330417": {
            "id": "740330417",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "...Sometimes I want to stuff him in a large bucket. That'll make him reflect on what he's done. Anyway, please take these Coupons.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330418"
            ]
          },
          "740330418": {
            "id": "740330418",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Take them, you two, if you would.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330419"
            ]
          },
          "740330419": {
            "id": "740330419",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What? You want us to take all of it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330420"
            ]
          },
          "740330420": {
            "id": "740330420",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Of course.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330421"
            ]
          },
          "740330421": {
            "id": "740330421",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Thank you, then. We can go to the Rag and Bone Shop later to see if they have anything new.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330422"
            ]
          },
          "740330422": {
            "id": "740330422",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "By the way, I'd like to apologize for dragging you into this. I have some fresh health drinks — would you like a bottle?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330423"
            ]
          },
          "740330423": {
            "id": "740330423",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Fresh... health drinks?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740330424"
            ]
          },
          "740330424": {
            "id": "740330424",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "Yup! Healthier than Pure Water, in fact!"
          },
          "740330414": {
            "id": "740330414",
            "speakerId": 21076,
            "speakerName": "Mitul",
            "text": "A customer with taste, I see."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}